    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to run a Japanese Game Centre? Now's your chance. Step into the world of Game Centre Simulator, and run your very own game centre. Buy claw machines, capsule toy machines and more, as you develop your game centre empire from a small alleyway to a huge multi storey in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, upgrade and repair your machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to take care of the menial tasks you can't be bothered with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with unique random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store, gaining space and multiple storeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move to a bigger store in a better location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day-night cycle, with unique events and customers at different times of the day</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wanted to run a Japanese Game Centre? Now's your chance. Step into the world of Game Centre Simulator, and run your very own game centre. Buy claw machines, capsule toy machines and more, as you develop your game centre empire from a small alleyway to a huge multi storey in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy, sell, upgrade and repair your machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to take care of the menial tasks you can't be bothered with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with unique random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your store, gaining space and multiple storeys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move to a bigger store in a better location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a full day-night cycle, with unique events and customers at different times of the day</p></li></ul>",
